WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.11 · Marketing & Communications
Media relations and press materials

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Be ready for the media: a current kit, a few contacts and agreed spokespeople.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep a short press kit with facts and approved photos.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Build relationships with a few relevant journalists.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Never put participants forward without consent and support.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Press kit in English and Malayalam; six regional contacts; Sreeja and Meera speak; weavers only if they choose.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a press kit checklist and media list.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
